---
// About Section Component - "Nuestra Promesa"
---

<section id="sobre-nosotros" class="about section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-image-container fade-in-left">
        <img 
          src="/images/abogado_horizontal2.png" 
          alt="Oficina moderna del bufete de abogados FL, mostrando un espacio de trabajo profesional y acogedor." 
          class="about-image content-image"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="about-content fade-in-right">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="section-subtitle">Mi Compromiso</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">
            Comprometido con la 
            <span class="text-accent">Justicia y la Excelencia</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        
        <p class="about-description">
          Como abogado especializado, entiendo que cada caso es único y requiere una atención personalizada.
          Me dedico a brindar representación legal de primera calidad, combinando mi experiencia y
          conocimiento con un enfoque humano y cercano a cada cliente.
        </p>
        
        <ul class="commitment-list">
          <li class="commitment-item">
            <div class="commitment-icon">
              <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="commitment-text">
              <h4>Atención Personal</h4>
              <p>Trato directo conmigo en todo momento, sin intermediarios.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          
          <li class="commitment-item">
            <div class="commitment-icon">
              <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="commitment-text">
              <h4>Confianza y Cercanía</h4>
              <p>Construyo relaciones duraderas basadas en honestidad y compromiso.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          
          <li class="commitment-item">
            <div class="commitment-icon">
              <i class="fas fa-clock"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="commitment-text">
              <h4>Disponibilidad Total</h4>
              <p>Atención personalizada y respuesta rápida cuando me necesite.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        
        <div class="about-actions">
          <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-primary">Solicitar Consulta</a>
          <a href="#servicios" class="btn btn-outline">Ver Servicios</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* ==========================================================================
     Estilos de la Sección "Sobre Nosotros"
     ========================================================================== */
  .about {
    background-color: var(--color-white);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .about-image-container {
    order: 1;
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-image-container::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -2rem;
    right: -2rem;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .about-image {
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }
  
  .about-content {
    order: 2;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .about-content .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .about-description {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  
  .commitment-list {
    list-style: none;
    text-align: left;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .commitment-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--color-white);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
  }

  .commitment-item::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    height: 100%;
    width: 3px;
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    transform: scaleY(0);
    transform-origin: bottom;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  
  .commitment-icon {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
  }
  
  .commitment-icon::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    opacity: 0.2;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }
  
  .commitment-icon i {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  
  .commitment-text h4 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  .commitment-text p {
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .commitment-item:hover {
    transform: translateX(10px);
  }

  .commitment-item:hover::before {
    transform: scaleY(1);
  }

  .commitment-item:hover .commitment-icon {
    transform: rotate(-10deg);
  }

  .commitment-item:hover .commitment-icon::after {
    transform: scale(1.1);
    opacity: 0.3;
  }
  
  .about-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .about-actions .btn {
    min-width: 200px;
  }
  
  /* Media Query para Tablet */
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .commitment-list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .commitment-text h4 {
      font-size: 1.375rem;
    }
  }
  
  /* Media Query para Desktop */
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .about {
      padding-top: var(--spacing-xl);
      padding-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
    }

    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 6rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-image-container {
      order: 1;
    }

    .about-content {
      text-align: left;
    }

    .about-content .section-header {
      text-align: left;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .about-description {
      margin-left: 0;
      margin-right: 0;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .commitment-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .about-actions {
      justify-content: flex-start;
      margin-top: 4rem;
    }
  }

  /* Media Query para pantallas grandes */
  @media (min-width: 1280px) {
    .about-grid {
      gap: 8rem;
    }

    .about-content .section-header {
      margin-bottom: 5rem;
    }

    .commitment-item {
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .commitment-icon {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
    }

    .commitment-icon i {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }

    .commitment-text h4 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .commitment-text p {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
    }
  }
</style>
